Package: ClimateIndicatorProjections
Title: Climate Change Indicator Projections Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("AnnaClaire", "Marley", , "annaclaire.marley@erg.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Climate Change Indicator Projections Explorer visualizes how possible future changes compare with historical patterns in EPA’s Climate Change Indicators. 
  This tool aligns a selection of EPA’s observed indicators with data from the most recent global climate model comparison effort, showing how these indicators could evolve under continued climate change.
